    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Yes. We should consider standardizing the output of the report functions. gl.report.heterozygosity outputs the heterozygosities, but gl.report.callrate does not output the callrate values.That would make it easier for the users.</div><div><br></div><div>Alternatively, we could automatically add some individual metrics to the genlight object, which would include callrate.<br></div><div><br></div><div>A</div><br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
