groups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Arthur Georges<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, 26 June 2020 10:56<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> dartR &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [dartR] Re: Plot individual heterozygosity and missing data<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi Anna,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Try this.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"># Grab the test set<br>\r\n  gl &lt;- <a href=\"http://testset.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459128770000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0M19QeyIyBr5q2NR4Hp5Cz\">testset.gl</a><br>\r\n# Assign each individual as a population<br>\r\n  pop(gl) &lt;- indNames(gl)<br>\r\n# Calculate Heterozygosity<br>\r\n  hetro &lt;- gl.report.heterozygosity(gl)<br>\r\n# Display heterozygosity<br>\r\n  hetro$Ho    <br>\r\n# Calculate the call rate by individual<br>\r\n  ind.call.rate &lt;- 1 - rowSums(<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459128770000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3sHPGfd_AyuqIoOewq4-2T\">is.na</a>(as.matrix(gl)))/nLoc(gl)<br>\r\n# Display call rate<br>\r\n  ind.call.rate<br>\r\n#Plot heterozygosity against call rate<br>\r\n  plot(x=ind.call.rate,y=hetro$Ho)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;dartR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dartr+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/de7a5edc-e8ba-45eb-acd9-6f2fadad579co%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/de7a5edc-e8ba-45eb-acd9-6f2fadad579co%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459128770000&amp;usg=AOvVaw380KRjghnFaD2zjNqVfx5A\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/de7a5edc-e8ba-45eb-acd9-6f2fadad579co%40googlegroups.com</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;dartR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dartr+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br></blockquote></div>"
