     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Yes. We should consider standardizing the output of the report functions. gl.report.heterozygosity outputs the heterozygosities, but gl.report.callrate does not output the callrate values.That would make it easier for the users.</div><div><br></div><div>Alternatively, we could automatically add some individual metrics to the genlight object, which would include callrate.<br></div><div><br></div><div>A</div><br></div><br></blockquote></div></div>"
